    <id>stickynotes</id>
    <name>Sticky Notes</name>
    <namespace>StickyNotes</namespace>
    <summary>Simple sticky notes, shared notes and assigned tasks for Nextcloud.</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[
Sticky Notes adds quick notes and lightweight tasks directly to Nextcloud.
Create colored sticky notes, share them with users or groups, assign tasks,
set due dates, receive configurable notifications and keep important notes
visible on the Dashboard.
    ]]></description>
